{"summary":"Kids create images using 10 shapes, which come in 7 different colors.","description":"The classic pattern blocks games which we've all loved as kids have morphed into a fun touch screen app. With the “Kids Draw with Shapes” app, children can make creative images using only ten basic shapes, which come in seven different colors.  \n\nThere are two modes in this game - children can either choose to design free-style, or using a template.  There are 5 templates in each of the following 10 categories:\n\n - Aircraft\n - Animals\n - Birds\n - Dessert\n - Food\n - Kitchen\n - Plants\n - Ships\n - Transportation\n - Underwater\n\nThis full version of the game contains all 10 categories of images.\n\nChildren can save and view their artwork in the app’s Gallery.","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":null,"header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/O7SIibn5UpC6zCpmCcuse_qFY3K3KAjxP6mlhLZsFZODftgVFa119ZVgu_7NRT-RJRPuSY8YNFRRqcB99-ZGTQ","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/tNxqvnNlRMcTqBzMH45LelWeCDUqiJWOOBjgxTcJqrkVLi9XaSRhOEpcs8LJl0TJ5ZnWzqq8c_onCusp88egVw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/dNbe1QEAb2cNznt67QL3q2J5DvbUq9zmTjq6ZzfO6tHWKNMh0TniZcCKZ3gM4KDnx-iD0dDmGFxA6qi8Mr0r6A","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/g2JX7ctB24VQKcjLiJmXORRMBXG1ayjkO2MO_P2indLvTasH1sg0y9Frlz02cEQdtTccL1d0KHrJRnIlhQ0W","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/gPRKqUKeASg6iS32SNt3XaLit6Xb23R6FvUOV2NqZiGAmuirFIc8qeAZxGEyOWxKqbho0geMJMokP3kRjg_Row","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/euKZ7IUjfaM_rg1ryVDCdDHgl-LuSt642yYOVRp-VMFbT7aEIH4O7VOmgVs0cShLNkUCf3tVoXV6j0aRnDHq","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/TS0Gh0nDJj41rNcbO1Wco5UbCIx7wfu1Lo-xfVHBsGrHFv9nNxRbbpYqMPw9qco-aStQ_wW8LBmt0cN7U1-NYvQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/f9fLvr8N3pIbuJEIKP5k4Qq_8RxBZNjya98fedEPAEubPXjeq7Auy7CH7zA4jc5dSjmQJS_j91yttr6gdtfU","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/tNxqvnNlRMcTqBzMH45LelWeCDUqiJWOOBjgxTcJqrkVLi9XaSRhOEpcs8LJl0TJ5ZnWzqq8c_onCusp88eg